<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Detail Log</title><style>
:root{color-scheme:dark;--bg:#101311;--panel:#191e1b;--line:#303a33;--muted:#9aa89e;--lime:#c0ef7c}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:#f4f7f2;font:15px system-ui,sans-serif}main{max-width:1180px;margin:auto;padding:36px 24px}header,.row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}h1{font-size:30px;letter-spacing:-1px;margin:8px 0}h2{font-size:19px}p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}small,.eyebrow{color:var(--muted)}.eyebrow{letter-spacing:3px;font-size:11px}button,input,select,textarea{font:inherit;border-radius:10px}button{cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:11px 15px;background:#232b26;color:white}button.primary{background:var(--lime);color:#17210d;border:0;font-weight:700}.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px;margin:30px 0}.card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:22px}.value{font-size:30px;font-weight:650;margin:12px 0 4px}.accent{color:var(--lime)}.controls{display:flex;gap:10px;margin:20px 0;flex-wrap:wrap}input,select,textarea{background:#111612;border:1px solid var(--line);color:white;padding:12px;width:100%}input:focus,textarea:focus{outline:1px solid var(--lime)}.controls input{flex:1;min-width:180px}.controls select{width:auto}.jobs{display:grid;gap:12px}.job{padding:20px}.badge{font-size:12px;color:var(--lime);background:#2a3722;border-radius:20px;padding:5px 9px}.meta{display:flex;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:18px;color:var(--muted)}.meta strong{color:white;font-weight:550}.note{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px;margin-bottom:0;font-size:14px}.empty{text-align:center;padding:50px 20px}.demo{background:#2a3123;border:1px solid #485438;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;font-size:13px;color:#d1deb9;margin-bottom:20px}.photos{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:15px}.photos img{width:120px;height:90px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:8px}.photos a{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;text-decoration:none}.photos span{display:block}dialog{background:var(--panel);color:white;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;max-width:720px;width:95%;padding:26px}dialog::backdrop{background:#000b}form .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:15px}label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);display:block}label input,label textarea,label select{margin-top:7px}.full{grid-column:1/-1}.actions{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:9px;margin-top:24px}.sub{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}footer{margin-top:30px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;line-height:1.7}@media(max-width:650px){main{padding:22px 16px}.stats{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}.card{padding:16px}.value{font-size:25px}header{align-items:flex-start}h1{font-size:25px}form .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.row{flex-wrap:wrap}.meta{gap:12px}}
</style></head><body><main><header><div><div class="eyebrow">YOUR WORK. YOUR NUMBERS.</div><h1>Detail <span class="accent">Log.</span></h1><p style="margin:0">Track the job. Know your rate. Quote smarter.</p></div><button class="primary" id="add">+ Add a job</button></header><div class="stats"><section class="card"><small id="yearLabel">Year earnings</small><div class="value" id="earnings"></div><small>Total collected · not net profit</small></section><section class="card"><small>Average hourly</small><div class="value accent" id="hourly"></div><small>Collected ÷ total work hours</small></section><section class="card"><small>Vehicles detailed</small><div class="value" id="count"></div><small>Jobs in the selected year</small></section><section class="card"><small>Hours worked</small><div class="value" id="hours"></div><small>Total time on selected-year jobs</small></section></div><div id="demo" class="demo">Example jobs are showing so you can try the layout. <button id="clearDemo" style="padding:5px 9px;margin-left:8px">Start fresh</button></div><div class="row"><h2>Job history</h2><div><button id="export">Export backup</button> <button id="import">Import backup</button><input type="file" id="backupFile" accept="application/json" hidden></div></div><div class="controls"><input id="search" placeholder="Search vehicle, condition, service, or quote notes…" aria-label="Search jobs"><select id="year" aria-label="Select year"></select><select id="sort" aria-label="Sort jobs"><option value="date">Newest first</option><option value="rate">Highest hourly</option><option value="amount">Highest collected</option></select></div><div id="jobs" class="jobs"></div><footer>Saved in this browser on this device. Export a backup to keep a separate copy. Photos stay in your browser too; large photo collections may exceed browser storage. Earnings are amounts collected, with no expenses or taxes deducted. Search filters the job list; the summary cards always show the full selected year.</footer></main><dialog id="editor"><form id="form"><div class="row"><h2 id="formTitle">Add a job</h2><button type="button" id="close">✕</button></div><div class="grid"><label>Date<input type="date" id="date" required></label><label>Vehicle year<input id="vehicleYear" placeholder="2021" maxlength="4"></label><label>Make<input id="make" placeholder="Toyota" required></label><label>Model<input id="model" placeholder="4Runner" required></label><label>Service<input id="service" placeholder="Full interior detail" required></label><label>Starting condition<select id="condition"><option>Light</option><option>Moderate</option><option>Heavy</option><option>Severe</option></select></label><label>Price quoted ($)<input id="quoted" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" required></label><label>Amount collected ($)<input id="collected" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" required></label><label>Hours worked<input id="duration" type="number" min="0.01" step="0.01" placeholder="3.5" required></label><label>Quote next time ($, optional)<input id="nextQuote" type="number" min="0" step="0.01"></label><label class="full">Before-condition notes<textarea id="before" rows="2" placeholder="Pet hair on rear seats, stained carpets, packed sand…"></textarea></label><label class="full">Notes for quoting next time<textarea id="notes" rows="2" placeholder="What took extra time? What would you charge differently?"></textarea></label><label>Before photo<input type="file" id="beforePhoto" accept="image/*"><span class="sub">Leave blank to keep an existing photo.</span></label><label>After photo<input type="file" id="afterPhoto" accept="image/*"><span class="sub">Leave blank to keep an existing photo.</span></label></div><div class="actions"><button type="button" id="cancel">Cancel</button><button class="primary" type="submit">Save job</button></div><p id="error" style="color:#ffb8a6"></p></form></dialog><script>
